  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">JP for Quality Education in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa, Pakistan</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Improved Access to Quality Education in the Tribal Districts of Khyber Pakhtunkhwa Joint Programme addresses the social and cultural barriers that prevent access to quality education for girls. Implemented under the One UN umbrella, partners align joint programme aims and outcomes with the current Education Sector Plan for Khyber Pakhtunkhwa.</narrative>
  </description>
